{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15998","headline":"春来曲 · 王建","name":"春来曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春欲来，每日望春门早开。\n黄衫白马带尘土，逢着探春人却回。\n御堤内园晓过急，九衢大宅家家入。\n青帝少女染桃花，露妆初出红犹湿。\n光风暾暾蝶宛宛，遶树气匝枝柯软。\n可怜寒食街中郎，早起着得单衣裳。\n少年即见春好处，似我白头无好树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}